  "description": "Kim Minjae was the apple of his chaebol family's eye. However, his grandfather's company went bankrupt, and Minjae died coughing up blood in a corner of a cramped one room flat. Opening his eyes upon returning to when he was 17 years old, Minjae finds that he can see people's personal profiles...! A second chance has arrived like a miracle. Now, Kim Minjae knows. Who the traitors are, and who the loyal subjects are!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
